{"name": "Ectorider", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Save the world at full speed with your electromagnetic gadgets!\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"282\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/089198aad012661ce9d1ec3492cc0feb.avif?t=1789122598\" width=\"1044\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ectorider is a fast-paced 3D platformer combining Extreme Sports and Third Person Shooter. Fight a robot army with your super magnet or use them to do insane tricks with your rollerblades. Save the Ectomorphs and stop Professor Ecto's evil plan.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Electromagn\u00e9tique shooter\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"110\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/94a57847efb218b78c705e0b9e6c8e79.avif?t=1789122598\" width=\"845\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-hidden=\"true\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"234\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/9bbb7bd2b72ebf2ba59e089fa0786fc4.poster.avif?t=1789122598\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/9bbb7bd2b72ebf2ba59e089fa0786fc4.webm?t=1789122598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/9bbb7bd2b72ebf2ba59e089fa0786fc4.mp4?t=1789122598\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the powers of the super magnet to grab, throw, propell yourself at fullspeed, fly high in the air or smash robots into them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Extreme rollerblading\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"110\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/9bc7495833160fdbbf9fdea2a0468b77.avif?t=1789122598\" width=\"845\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-hidden=\"true\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"234\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/bfcd789c921dd585f2121fb9550f8dd8.poster.avif?t=1789122598\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/bfcd789c921dd585f2121fb9550f8dd8.webm?t=1789122598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/bfcd789c921dd585f2121fb9550f8dd8.mp4?t=1789122598\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dash, grind, and soar through levels on high-speed rollers. Chain tricks, wall-runs, and aerial stunts to keep your momentum flowing and your style sharp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Unleash your creativity\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"110\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/f773cf471374cf5f9777c0f815c346b3.avif?t=1789122598\" width=\"845\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-hidden=\"true\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"234\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/dc29e3733310bad9c1695e5361813ae4.poster.avif?t=1789122598\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/dc29e3733310bad9c1695e5361813ae4.webm?t=1789122598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/dc29e3733310bad9c1695e5361813ae4.mp4?t=1789122598\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover each enemies special ability, unlock new gadgets and combine them to find alternate paths into each levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Save the ectomorphs\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"110\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/d7982043abf746959c167ec3c2745097.avif?t=1789122598\" width=\"845\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-hidden=\"true\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"234\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/44b96aa2ff8de0c5776c7f6ea9509a2e.poster.avif?t=1789122598\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/44b96aa2ff8de0c5776c7f6ea9509a2e.webm?t=1789122598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/44b96aa2ff8de0c5776c7f6ea9509a2e.mp4?t=1789122598\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Humanity has been changed to Ectomorphs by the evil Professor Ecto! You must race at full speed around the world with your group of friends to find them, fight Ecto's robot army and turn them back into humans.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Ectorider is a fast-paced 3D platformer combining Extreme Sports and Third Person Shooter. Fight a robot army with your super magnet or use them to do insane tricks with your rollerblades. Save the Ectomorphs and stop Professor Ecto's evil plan.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/f94d7829111f192847f444643339574dd9b31846/header.jpg?t=1789122598", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Fast-Paced", "3D Platformer", "Action", "Pla